CRATE MAN  Windows v1.1b Soleau Crate11.zip
A pure animated strategy logic game. 50 red
crates containing the lost treasures of King
Kalaporus have been discovered in the 
warehouses of B.B. Billings & Sons.  A worker
named Curtis the Crate Man must reach the red
crates in each puzzle room. Using ingenuity 
and problem solving skills, can you help him
recover all the lost treasures?  A puzzer's
delight! Req:486 or Pentium 4 Megs Ram free 
